<title>USA: Tejon knows no reason for stock activity.</title>
<headline>Tejon knows no reason for stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>LEBEC, Calif. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tejon Ranch Co said Friday it is  not aware of any material reason for the recent activity and trading  volume in its stock.</p>
<p>The company said it had no material information regarding its business  or operations that has not been previously disclosed to the public  that, in its opinion, could account for the recent stock activity.</p>
<p>Shares of Tejon closed up 2-1/8 at $25-5/8 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
